    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On the 18th and 19th of January, 2018, the Network of Blended and Digital Learning (BDL) facilitated the level two training of the Virtual Learning Environment Rollout Programme at the School of Nursing and Midwifery (SONAM) in Kenya.",
